<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">VOCABULARIO EN CRECIMIENTO</view><view class="title">6500 词，慢慢用起来。</view><view class="subtitle">6483 个单词 + 17 个表达 · 去重计数 · A1 → B2 教学顺序</view>
<view class="card"><view class="list-title">今天学哪一组？</view><view class="small body">每日范围：{{track === 'bank' ? '扩展词库（6500）' : '课内词汇（320 词卡）'}}。扩展模式先巩固已解锁的课内词，再加入新词。</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="primary" bindtap="activate">用于每日词汇训练</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="course">切回课内词汇</button></view>
<view class="level-tabs"><button hover-class="button-press" class="{{!level ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-level="" bindtap="select">全部</button><button hover-class="button-press" wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="id" class="{{level === item.id ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-level="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{item.id}}</button></view>
<block wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="id"><view wx:if="{{level === item.id}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">{{item.id}} · {{item.total}} 词</view><view class="pill">{{item.unlocked ? '可训练' : '可预览'}}</view></view><view class="body">已学习 {{item.learned}} · 记忆确认 {{item.confirmed}} / {{item.total}}</view><view class="small">累计词量目标 {{item.cumulative}}；{{item.unlockReason}}。确认可来自自评或测验，不是考试能力证明。</view></view></block>
<view class="note">阶段配额与排序为本站参考词频编排，不是官方逐词 CEFR 定级。扩展词条保留英文原义；中文多为英中中转辅助释义，尚待西语语境复核。名词性别与地区用法请查原词条。没有例句的词条不生成虚构例句。</view>
<input class="search" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索西语、中文或英文原义" maxlength="100" /><view class="row"><view class="small">{{count}} 个词条 · 第 {{page + 1}} / {{pages}} 页</view><view class="small">每页最多 30 词</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{!count}}" class="card empty">没有找到这个词，试试其他关键词。</view>
<view wx:for="{{words}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">{{item.spanish}}</view><view class="pill">{{item.level}} · {{item.locked ? '预览' : item.learned ? '已学习' : '未学习'}}</view></view><view class="body">{{item.meaning}}</view><view class="small">{{item.pos}} · {{item.bank ? '中文辅助释义（待复核）' : '课内词条'}}</view><block wx:if="{{expanded === item.id}}"><view class="divider"></view><block wx:if="{{item.bank}}"><view class="body">英文原义：{{item.definition}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.pivot}}" class="small body">英中对应词：{{item.pivot}}</view><view class="small body">开源词典派生数据 CC BY-SA 4.0；中文提示含 MIT ECDICT 数据。来源版本与修改说明见资料库。</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-url="{{item.sourceUrl}}" catchtap="copy">复制词义来源链接</button></block><block wx:else><view class="example">{{item.example}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.translation}}</view></block><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-url="{{item.dictionaryUrl}}" catchtap="copy">复制 RAE 查询链接</button></block></view>
<view class="row body"><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" disabled="{{page === 0}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="paginate">上一页</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" disabled="{{page + 1 >= pages}}" data-step="1" bindtap="paginate">下一页</button></view>
<view class="section-title">20 词一组，练完再表达</view><view wx:for="{{packs}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">{{item.level}} 词组 {{item.number}}</view><view class="pill">{{item.total}} 词</view></view><view class="body muted">{{item.preview}}…</view><view class="row body"><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-locked="{{item.locked}}" bindtap="study">词卡</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-locked="{{item.locked}}" bindtap="quiz">测验</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expression">组词表达</button></view></view><view class="row body"><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" disabled="{{packPage === 0}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="paginatePacks">前一组</button><view class="small">{{packPage + 1}} / {{packPages}}</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" disabled="{{packPage + 1 >= packPages}}" data-step="1" bindtap="paginatePacks">后一组</button></view><button hover-class="button-press" class="ghost" bindtap="back">返回课内词汇 →</button></view>
